[LINK 3c] N(E) ⊆ S7(E):  maxgap<=1/7  ==>  hits every 1/7-sector
  N(E) ⊆ S7(E) verified on random (E,x) with maxgap<=1/7: True
  PROOF: maxgap<=1/7 means consecutive phase-gaps <=1/7; a sector [j/7,(j+1)/7) of
